## Engine balancing loops (internal reference)

Agents rarely edit these; included so calorie constants in code are understandable.

| Loop | Target | Formula (per serving) |
|------|--------|------------------------|
| **Protein `T9`** | Daily protein grams `QG` | `(P1+D1)×32 + (G1+S2)×3` |
| **Carb `TC`** | Daily carb calories `C7` | `D1×48 + (G1+S2)×56 + VE×40 + FQ×72` |
| **Fat `TF`** | Maintain fat budget `FC` | `P1×18 + D1×22 + G1×9 + (S2+FQ)×4 + VE×3` |
| **Extra fat** | Fills gap to total maintain `T8` | `FT × 45` |

**Calorie constants decoded** (macro grams × 4 cal/g or 9 cal/g):

| Constant | Macro meaning |
|----------|---------------|
| 32 | 8g protein |
| 48 | 12g carbs (dairy) |
| 56 | 14g carbs (grain/starch) |
| 40 | 10g carbs (vegetable) |
| 72 | Fruit energy slot |
| 18 | 2g fat (protein) |
| 22 | ~2.4g fat (dairy) |
| 9 | 1g fat (grain) |
| 4 | ~0.44g fat (starch/fruit) |
| 3 | ~0.33g fat (vegetable) |
| 45 | 1 extra-fat point |

