### KWarner program report PDF

See `.cursor/rules/kwarner-preview-pdf.mdc`. Renderer: `server/pdf/renderProgramReportKwarnerLockedPreview.js`.

| Page | Grams? |
|------|--------|
| Servings | **Counts only** |
| Food list (protein, grains, veg, fruit) | **Scaled grams** |
| Flavor kits | No gram servings |

### Food-list scaling (`js/stapleServingPrintout.js`)

```
displayed grams = stapleCategoryServings(planServings, category) × base one-serving weight
```

| Food-list section | Multiplier |
|-------------------|------------|
| Protein + dairy | `planServings.protein / 3` |
| Grains & starches | `planServings.grainsStarches / 3` |
| Vegetables | `planServings.vegetables` (daily) |
| Fruit | `planServings.fruits / 3` |
| Extra fat / sugar / alcohol | Not on staple pages |

Payload: `payload.servings.planServings` from `js/programReportPrintout.js`.

### Print Shop (menu planner)

| Document | Scaling |
|----------|---------|
| Weekly meal plan | `gramWeightLabel()` — `menuplanner/js/plannerPrintPayload.js` |
| Grocery list | `foodAmountLabel()` — weekly totals |
| Generic food list (`foodlist` view) | Static names + tips only — no personalized grams |

